You need:

- A supported Node.js LTS release
- An Azure subscription with Azure OpenAI access
- An Azure OpenAI resource
- A deployed chat model
- Visual Studio Code or another editor
- Basic knowledge of JavaScript, JSON, HTTP, and REST APIs

From Azure, record the following values:

- Azure OpenAI endpoint
- Model deployment name
- API version supported by your resource
- API key for initial local development

> Your **deployment name** is the name assigned when deploying the model in Azure. It may be different from the underlying model family name.

